    <bpmn:process id="W_W892" name="W892. Customer Statement Generation &amp; Distribution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly statement cycle (1st business day of month); ad-hoc on customer request
Frequency: Monthly (all active accounts); ad-hoc as needed
Volume: ~5,200 trade + ~200 corporate statements/month
Owner: AR Clerk
Participants: AR Clerk, AR Supervisor
Source: workflow W892 — Customer Statement Generation &amp; Distribution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W892_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W892_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W892_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W892_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W892_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W892_Lane2" name="AR Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W892_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W892_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W892_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W892_Start4" name="Monthly statement cycle (1st business day of month); ad-hoc on customer request">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W892_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W892_Task5" name="System generates monthly customer statements for all active AR accounts with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System generates monthly customer statements for all active AR accounts with open balances: opening balance, invoice details (date, number, amount), payments applied, adjustments (credit notes, debit notes), closing balance, and aging summary
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W892_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W892_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W892_Task6" name="AR Clerk reviews statements for accuracy: correct entity, proper contact…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: AR Clerk reviews statements for accuracy: correct entity, proper contact details, aging buckets match GL subledger
Responsible (R): AR Clerk
Accountable (A): AR Supervisor
Duration: 1 hour/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W892_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W892_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W892_Task7" name="System distributes statements via configured channel: (a) email (default for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System distributes statements via configured channel: (a) email (default for ~80% of accounts), (b) customer portal self-service download, (c) printed and mailed for accounts without email (~20%)
Responsible (R): System / AR Clerk
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W892_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W892_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W892_Task8" name="Ad-hoc statement requests from customers or Sales Reps processed within 1…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Ad-hoc statement requests from customers or Sales Reps processed within 1 business day
Responsible (R): AR Clerk
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 min/request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W892_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W892_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W892_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W892_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
